        <mxCell id="14" value="decide(student: VerifiedStudent, tx: LockedWorkshopTx)&#10;    -&gt; AllocationResult&#10;1. Missing workshop -&gt; NotFound.&#10;2. Existing reservation for student -&gt; Existing(same row).&#10;3. Not published -&gt; Unpublished.&#10;4. count &gt;= capacity -&gt; Full; otherwise insert one row." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#152b46;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
