        <mxCell id="20" value="StudentId, WorkshopId, ReservationId = opaque strings&#10;Instant = timezone-aware timestamp&#10;VerifiedStudent = {studentId: StudentId, name: str, email: str}&#10;AuthResult = VerifiedStudent | Unverified&#10;Reservation = {id: ReservationId, workshopId: WorkshopId,&#10; studentId: StudentId, name: str, email: str, createdAt: Instant}&#10;AllocationResult = Created(Reservation, Workshop)&#10; | Existing(Reservation) | NotFound | Unpublished | Full&#10;ReserveResult = Created(Reservation, Requested | Unavailable)&#10; | Existing(Reservation) | Rejected(Unverified | NotFound&#10; | Unpublished | Full) | StorageUnavailable" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#152b46;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
