        <mxCell id="24" value="workshop: Workshop | None&#10;findExisting(studentId: StudentId) -&gt; Reservation | None&#10;countReservations() -&gt; int&#10;insert(student: VerifiedStudent) -&gt; Reservation&#10;All methods use the same SQL transaction / connection.&#10;Workshop = {id, ownerId, title, startsAt: Instant,&#10; capacity: int in 1..20, published: bool}.&#10;runLocked(workshopId, decide) -&gt; AllocationResult&#10;returns only after successful COMMIT.&#10;Separate SELECT statements follow the row-lock query." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#152b46;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
